">\n                        Hỗ trợ Khóa luận tốt nghiệp\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-10 leading-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section title\">\n                        Vượt qua áp lực\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                        bảo vệ thành công tương lai\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg opacity-80 mb-14 leading-relaxed font-light\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-3\" data-name=\"thesis section description\">\n                        Chúng tôi hiểu những đêm trắng bên trang giấy. Với sự đồng hành từ các cố vấn chuyên gia, \"Kết Nối Học\" giúp bạn hoàn thiện tư duy nghiên cứu và đạt kết quả tốt nhất.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4\" data-name=\"statistic items grid\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"stat 1 item\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[var(--terracotta)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"stat 1 icon wrapper\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-users-group text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"users group icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span class=\"font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"stat 1 number\">\n                                    524+\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm font-medium opacity-70 leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"stat 1 description\">\n                                Sinh viên bảo vệ khóa luận xuất sắc thông qua quy trình hỗ trợ 5 bước chuẩn hóa.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"stat 2 item\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[var(--sage)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"stat 2 icon wrapper\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-certificate text-3xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"certificate icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span class=\"font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"stat 2 number\">\n                                    100%\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm font-medium opacity-70 leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"stat 2 description\">\n                                Gia sư hướng dẫn có bằng Thạc sĩ trở lên hoặc kinh nghiệm tối thiểu 3 đề tài nghiên cứu cấp Bộ.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"testimonial visual block\">\n                    <div class=\"organic-blob w-72 h-72 bg-[var(--terracotta)]/20 -top-16 -left-16 animate-float\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"decorative background blob\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"clay-card p-12 relative z-10 border border-[var(--mocha)]/5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial card\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-quote text-7xl text-[var(--terracotta)] opacity-10 absolute top-8 right-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"quote icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <p class=\"text-2xl font-medium mb-12 leading-relaxed text-[var(--mocha)] italic font-heading\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial text\">\n                            \"Sự chuyên nghiệp trong cách hướng dẫn đã giúp mình không chỉ đạt điểm cao mà còn thực sự hiểu sâu về đề tài nghiên cứu của mình.\"\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"testimonial author info\">\n                            <img alt=\"Lê Thu Trang\" class=\"w-18 h-18 rounded-[24px] object-cover shadow-xl border-4 border-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"author portrait\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?u=student-trang\"/>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"author details\">\n                                <h5 class=\"font-bold text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"author name\">\n                                    Lê Thu Trang\n                                </h5>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm opacity-50 font-medium tracking-wide\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"author affiliation\">\n                                    Khoa Kinh tế • ĐH Kinh tế Quốc dân\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- Dual CTA Section (Redesigned) -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"dual cta section\">\n            <div class=\"relative bg-white rounded-[64px] border border-[var(--mocha)]/5 overflow-hidden p-12 lg:p-20 shadow-2xl shadow-[var(--mocha)]/5\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"cta container\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,_var(--cream)_0%,_transparent_60%)] -z-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"background gradient overlay\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"cta grid layout\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"cta text content\">\n                        <h2 class=\"font-heading text-5xl font-extrabold mb-8 leading-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"cta section title\">\n                            Bạn đã sẵn sàng\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>\n                            kết nối?\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-xl opacity-70 mb-12 font-light leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"cta section description\">\n                            Dù bạn đang tìm kiếm người dẫn dắt hay muốn truyền thụ kinh nghiệm, Kết Nối Học luôn là môi trường học thuật chuyên nghiệp dành cho bạn.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"cta button group\">\n                            <button class=\"bg-[var(--mocha)] text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-bold clay-button clay-button-mocha hover:bg-[var(--terracotta)] transition-colors group cursor-pointer\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"search tutor call-to-action button\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-search mr-2 group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"search icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Tìm gia sư ngay\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"border-2 border-[var(--mocha)] text-[var(--mocha)] px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-bold hover:bg-[var(--mocha)] hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"register to teach call-to-action button\">\n                                Đăng ký dạy học\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative hidden lg:block\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"cta decorative visual area\">\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cta feature cards grid\">\n                            <div class=\"space-y-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"cta left column\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-[var(--cream)] p-8 rounded-[40px] border border-[var(--mocha)]/5 shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"cta card 1\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"icon wrapper\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-users text-2xl text-[var(--terracotta)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"users icon\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"cta card title\">\n                                        Học viên\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"cta card description\">\n                                        Lựa chọn người phù hợp nhất với lộ trình cá nhân.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"bg-[var(--mocha)] text-white p-8 rounded-[40px] translate-x-8 shadow-xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"cta card 2\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-white/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"icon wrapper\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-certificate text-2xl text-[var(--sage)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"certificate icon\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"cta card title\">\n                                        Gia sư\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"cta card description\">\n                                        Xây dựng thương hiệu cá nhân uy tín.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"pt-20\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"cta right column\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-[40px] border border-[var(--mocha)]/5 shadow-xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"cta card 3\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[var(--terracotta)]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"icon wrapper\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-sparkles text-2xl text-[var(--terracotta)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"sparkles icon\">\n                                        </i>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"cta card title\">\n                                        AI Matching\n                                    </h4>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"cta card description\">\n                                        Tự động kết nối dựa trên sự tương đồng phong cách.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- Minimal Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-16 pb-20 border-b border-[var(--mocha)]/5\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"footer links container\">\n                <div class=\"col-span-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand section\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo and name group\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[var(--terracotta)] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo initial\">\n                            K\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">\n                            Kết Nối Học\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm opacity-50 max-w-xs leading-loose font-light\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer description\">\n                        Hệ sinh thái giáo dục hiện đại, đề cao sự minh bạch và tinh thần cộng đồng. Đồng hành cùng tri thức Việt.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2\" data-name=\"footer column 1\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-sm mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"column title\">\n                        Khám phá\n                    </h5>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-5 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"link list\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"list item 1\">\n                            <a class=\"footer-link block opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"footer nav link\" href=\"#\">\n                                Môn học\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"list item 2\">\n                            <a class=\"footer-link block opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"footer nav link\" href=\"#\">\n                                Gia sư giỏi\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"list item 3\">\n                            <a class=\"footer-link block opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"footer nav link\" href=\"#\">\n                                Lớp học mới\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3\" data-name=\"footer column 2\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-sm mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-1\" data-name=\"column title\">\n                        Công ty\n                    </h5>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-5 text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-2\" data-name=\"link list\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"list item 1\">\n                            <a class=\"footer-link block opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"footer nav link\" href=\"#\">\n                                Về chúng tôi\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"list item 2\">\n                            <a class=\"footer-link block opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"footer nav link\" href=\"#\">\n                                Điều khoản\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"list item 3\">\n                            <a class=\"footer-link block opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"footer nav link\" href=\"#\">\n                                Bảo mật\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-span-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4\" data-name=\"footer column 3\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-sm mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-1\" data-name=\"column title\">\n                        Liên hệ\n                    </h5>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-2\" data-name=\"contact list\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"phone item\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-phone text-lg\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"phone icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"phone number\">\n                                Hotline: 1900 8888\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"email item\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-mail text-lg\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"email icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"email address\">\n                                Email: hello@ketnoihoc.vn\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pt-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2\" data-name=\"footer bottom bar\">\n                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-black opacity-30 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-1\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n                    © 2026 Kết Nối Học. Kiến tạo tương lai tri thức.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2\" data-name=\"social links\">\n                    <a class=\"opacity-30 hover:opacity-100 hover:text-[var(--terracotta)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"facebook link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-brand-facebook text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"facebook icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"opacity-30 hover:opacity-100 hover:text-[var(--terracotta)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-2\" data-name=\"linkedin link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-brand-linkedin text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"linkedin icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"opacity-30 hover:opacity-100 hover:text-[var(--terracotta)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-3\" data-name=\"youtube link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-brand-youtube text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"youtube icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </main>\n    <!-- Chat Floating Interaction -->\n    <button class=\"fixed bottom-10 right-10 w-20 h-20 bg-[var(--terracotta)] text-white rounded-full shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(228,77,46,0.4)] flex items-center justify-center z-50 hover:scale-110 active:scale-95 transition-all group cursor-pointer border-4 border-white/20\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"chatbot floating trigger button\" id=\"chatbot-trigger\">\n        <i class=\"ti ti-message-dots text-3xl group-hover:scale-0 transition-transform duration-300\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"chat icon\">\n        </i>\n        <i class=\"ti ti-sparkles text-4xl absolute scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-transform duration-300\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"sparkle icon\">\n        </i>\n    </button>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\n    import Lenis from \"https://esm.sh/lenis@1\"\n    import { animate, scroll, spring, inView } from \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/motion@12/+esm\"\n\n    // GSAP Setup\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n    // Initialize Lenis\n    const lenis = new Lenis({\n        lerp: 0.1,\n        duration: 1.5,\n        smoothWheel: true,\n    });\n\n    function raf(time) {\n        lenis.raf(time);\n        requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n\n    // Initial Entrance Animations (using Motion)\n    animate(\"h1\", { opacity: [0, 1], y: [60, 0] }, { duration: 1, ease: \"easeOut\" });\n    animate(\"p\", { opacity: [0, 1], y: [30, 0] }, { duration: 1, delay: 0.2 });\n    animate(\".search-container\", { opacity: [0, 1], y: [20, 0], scale: [0.95, 1] }, { duration: 0.8, delay: 0.4, ease: spring({ bounce: 0.3 }) });\n\n    // Scroll Reveal for Subjects\n    inView(\".subject-card\", (info) => {\n        animate(info.target, { opacity: [0, 1], y: [40, 0], scale: [0.8, 1] }, { \n            duration: 0.6, \n            delay: Number(info.target.dataset.index || 0) * 0.1,\n            ease: spring({ bounce: 0.4 }) \n        });\n    });\n\n    // Carousel Logic\n    const track = document.getElementById('tutor-track');\n    const nextBtn = document.getElementById('carousel-next');\n    const prevBtn = document.getElementById('carousel-prev');\n\n    nextBtn.addEventListener('click', () => track.scrollBy({ left: 450, behavior: 'smooth' }));\n    prevBtn.addEventListener('click', () => track.scrollBy({ left: -450, behavior: 'smooth' }));\n\n    // AI Search Trigger Mockup\n    const heroSearchBtn = document.getElementById('hero-search-btn');\n    heroSearchBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const originalText = heroSearchBtn.innerHTML;\n        heroSearchBtn.classList.add('opacity-70', 'pointer-events-none');\n        heroSearchBtn.innerHTML = '<i class=\"ti ti-loader-2 animate-spin text-xl\"></i> Phân tích...';\n        \n        setTimeout(() => {\n            heroSearchBtn.classList.remove('opacity-70', 'pointer-events-none');\n            heroSearchBtn.innerHTML = '<i class=\"ti ti-sparkles text-xl\"></i> Đã hoàn thành';\n            lenis.scrollTo('#ai-section', { offset: -100, duration: 1.2 });\n            \n            setTimeout(() => {\n                heroSearchBtn.innerHTML = originalText;\n            }, 3000);\n        }, 1200);\n    });\n\n    // Chatbot Trigger Demo\n    const chatBtn = document.getElementById('chatbot-trigger');\n    chatBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        lenis.scrollTo('#ai-section', { offset: -100 });\n        animate(\"#chat-feed\", { x: [-20, 0], opacity: [0.8, 1] }, { duration: 0.5 });\n    });\n\n    // Organic Shapes Parallax (using GSAP for smooth scroll-tied)\n    gsap.to(\".organic-blob\", {\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: \"main\",\n            start: \"top top\",\n            end: \"bottom bottom\",\n            scrub: 2,\n        },\n        y: (i, target) => i % 2 === 0 ? -100 : 100,\n        rotation: 45,\n        ease: \"none\"\n    });\n</script>\n",
